# The Alliance Rogue level 10 quests, one chain per home town, each ending
# with the Blade of Cunning (7298), a dagger:
# - Goldshire (Humans, and Skyborne, who reach Stormwind at about 15): Seek
#   out SI: 7 and Snatch and Grab (2205, 2206).
# - Kharanos (Dwarves, Gnomes): Road to Salvation, Simple Subterfugin' and
#   Onin's Report (2218, 2238, 2239).
# - Dolanaar (Night Elves): The Apple Falls and Destiny Calls (2241, 2242).
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the givers,
# drops and places; travel.json for the inns; Forever's Rogue class
# quest list (data/local/quest-audit/) for the rewards and
# Forever's changes (none for these chains). The quests' race masks take any
# Alliance race; the race split follows where each race is at level 10.
# The leveling guides leave these out: they teach no spell.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Goldshire

step Seek out SI: 7
  only Human,Skyborne
  tip At 10 Keryn Sylvius, the rogue trainer in the Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire, gives you a package for Master Mathias Shaw in Stormwind.
  level 10
  accept 2205                                 -- Keryn Sylvius

step Master Mathias Shaw
  only Human,Skyborne
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Head north to Stormwind; Mathias Shaw is at SI:7 in Old Town.
  turnin 2205                                 -- Master Mathias Shaw
  accept 2206

step Defias Dockmaster
  only Human,Skyborne
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip The Defias Dockmaster stands by the river at Elwynn's southern edge, south of Goldshire. He carries the shipping schedule.
  collect 7675 quest 2206.1                   -- Defias Shipping Schedule: Defias Dockmaster

step Back to Mathias Shaw
  only Human,Skyborne
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 2206 reward 7298                     -- Master Mathias Shaw, SI:7

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Kharanos

step Road to Salvation
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip At 10 Hogral Bakkan, the rogue trainer in the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos, sends you to Hulfdan Blackbeard in Ironforge.
  level 10
  accept 2218                                 -- Hogral Bakkan

step Hulfdan Blackbeard
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  tip Hulfdan Blackbeard stands in the north of Ironforge.
  turnin 2218                                 -- Hulfdan Blackbeard
  accept 2238

step Onin MacHammar
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Onin waits near Gnomeregan, in western Dun Morogh.
  turnin 2238                                 -- Onin MacHammar
  accept 2239

step Back to Hulfdan
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 2239 reward 7298                     -- Hulfdan Blackbeard, Ironforge

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Dolanaar

step The Apple Falls
  only NightElf
  zone Teldrassil
  tip At 10 Jannok Breezesong, the rogue trainer in Dolanaar, gives you a rose for Syurna in Darnassus.
  level 10
  accept 2241                                 -- Jannok Breezesong

step Syurna
  only NightElf
  zone Darnassus
  tip Head west to Darnassus. Syurna stands in the north-west of the city.
  turnin 2241                                 -- Syurna
  accept 2242

step Sethir the Ancient
  only NightElf
  zone Teldrassil
  tip Sethir the Ancient lives in the north of Teldrassil, north-east of Darnassus. Take his journal.
  collect 7737 quest 2242.1                   -- Sethir's Journal: Sethir the Ancient

step Back to Syurna
  only NightElf
  zone Darnassus
  turnin 2242 reward 7298                     -- Syurna, Darnassus
